eading-[1.25rem]"><div class="w-[calc(100%-1rem-4px)] overflow-hidden max-h-[3.75rem]" style="display:-webkit-box;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;-webkit-line-clamp:3">Branded as a family jinx, Bonnie was cast out as a child, left mute by a fever, and taken in by a poor family who renamed her Sunny. Years later, she enters college, only to be bullied by a wealthy classmate—her twin brother, though neither knows the truth. As their fates entwine, can Bonnie uncover the secrets of her banishment and reclaim her place in the family?</div></div></div><div class="episode-list text-white mt-10 "><div class="flex justify-between h-[2.25rem] border-b border-white/10 mb-5"><span>Full episodes</span><span>70<!-- --> Episodes</span></div><div class=""><div class="flex mb-4 h-[11.75rem] cursor-pointer"><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954"><img alt="Love Lights My Way Back Home" loading="lazy" width="142" height="188" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[8.875rem] h-full rounded-lg max-w-none object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/51b6fe5c59804a6baa061739c8cf244c~tplv-vod-noop.image"/></a><div class="ml-4 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis"><h2 class="text-white poppins-bold text-[14px] font-bold break-words overflow-hidden text-ellipsis max-h-[calc(1.5em*2)] leading-snug line-clamp-2 md:text-[20px]"><span><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954">EP 1<!-- -->-<!-- -->The Jinxed Twin</a></span></h2><div class="text-[#A3A3A3] text-[14px] break-words mt-[0.875rem] poppins overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-3">The Golden family believes Bonnie is a jinx bringing misfortune, leading to her forced exile by her grandfather, despite her parents&#x27; desperate pleas.Will Bonnie ever reunite with her family and uncover the truth behind her banishment?</div></div></div><div class="flex mb-4 h-[11.75rem] cursor-pointer"><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954"><img alt="Love Lights My Way Back Home" loading="lazy" width="142" height="188" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[8.875rem] h-full rounded-lg max-w-none object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/84f5af5334704a4496676c47c581a5ee~tplv-vod-noop.image"/></a><div class="ml-4 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis"><h2 class="text-white poppins-bold text-[14px] font-bold break-words overflow-hidden text-ellipsis max-h-[calc(1.5em*2)] leading-snug line-clamp-2 md:text-[20px]"><span><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954-ep-2">EP 2<!-- -->-<!-- -->The Silent Beginning</a></span></h2><div class="text-[#A3A3A3] text-[14px] break-words mt-[0.875rem] poppins overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-3">The episode begins with a tragic turn as a young girl, later named Sunny, is found abandoned and suffering from a fever that leaves her mute. Years later, her adoptive father, Shaw, receives unexpected news that Sunny has earned a prestigious scholarship to Eaton Academy, only to be urgently called to the school due to an undisclosed problem involving Sunny.What trouble has Sunny encountered at Eaton Academy, and how will it unveil the hidden truths of her past?</div></div></div><div class="flex mb-4 h-[11.75rem] cursor-pointer"><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954"><img alt="Love Lights My Way Back Home" loading="lazy" width="142" height="188" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[8.875rem] h-full rounded-lg max-w-none object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/e1e64e70fd664a3c83c060934ad24d59~tplv-vod-noop.image"/></a><div class="ml-4 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis"><h2 class="text-white poppins-bold text-[14px] font-bold break-words overflow-hidden text-ellipsis max-h-[calc(1.5em*2)] leading-snug line-clamp-2 md:text-[20px]"><span><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954-ep-3">EP 3<!-- -->-<!-- -->Bullying Exposed</a></span></h2><div class="text-[#A3A3A3] text-[14px] break-words mt-[0.875rem] poppins overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-3">Sunny faces bullying from her wealthy classmate Chuck Golden, who is unaware that she is his twin sister. When Chuck refuses to apologize for cutting her uniform, the situation escalates as the teacher calls his parents, setting the stage for a dramatic confrontation.Will Chuck&#x27;s parents recognize Sunny as their long-lost daughter when they arrive?</div></div></div><div class="flex mb-4 h-[11.75rem] cursor-pointer"><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954"><img alt="Love Lights My Way Back Home" loading="lazy" width="142" height="188" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[8.875rem] h-full rounded-lg max-w-none object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/25f27ab1aa9d41ed91bf4b478383fe43~tplv-vod-noop.image"/></a><div class="ml-4 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis"><h2 class="text-white poppins-bold text-[14px] font-bold break-words overflow-hidden text-ellipsis max-h-[calc(1.5em*2)] leading-snug line-clamp-2 md:text-[20px]"><span><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954-ep-4">EP 4<!-- -->-<!-- -->Family Secrets and School Bullying</a></span></h2><div class="text-[#A3A3A3] text-[14px] break-words mt-[0.875rem] poppins overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-3">In this intense episode, tensions escalate when Bonnie (Sunny Shaw) is bullied by her wealthy classmate Chuck, who unknowingly is her twin brother. The situation comes to a head when Chuck insults Bonnie&#x27;s adoptive family, provoking a violent reaction. The school director is forced to intervene as the conflict reveals deeper family secrets and unresolved issues.Will Bonnie uncover the truth about her connection to Chuck and reclaim her rightful place in the family?</div></div></div><div class="flex mb-4 h-[11.75rem] cursor-pointer"><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954"><img alt="Love Lights My Way Back Home" loading="lazy" width="142" height="188" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[8.875rem] h-full rounded-lg max-w-none object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/6bc2ff998a7147ef975c869c90364b1e~tplv-vod-noop.image"/></a><div class="ml-4 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis"><h2 class="text-white poppins-bold text-[14px] font-bold break-words overflow-hidden text-ellipsis max-h-[calc(1.5em*2)] leading-snug line-clamp-2 md:text-[20px]"><span><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954-ep-5">EP 5<!-- -->-<!-- -->Twin&#x27;s Cruelty</a></span></h2><div class="text-[#A3A3A3] text-[14px] break-words mt-[0.875rem] poppins overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-3">Sunny faces severe bullying from her wealthy classmate, who unknowingly is her twin brother, leading to a confrontation where she&#x27;s threatened with expulsion unless her father kneels in apology.Will Sunny&#x27;s father kneel to keep her in school, or will this confrontation reveal more about her mysterious past?</div></div></div><div class="flex mb-4 h-[11.75rem] cursor-pointer"><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954"><img alt="Love Lights My Way Back Home" loading="lazy" width="142" height="188" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[8.875rem] h-full rounded-lg max-w-none object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/858d6b09d90d4ae39511a88bc49696f7~tplv-vod-noop.image"/></a><div class="ml-4 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis"><h2 class="text-white poppins-bold text-[14px] font-bold break-words overflow-hidden text-ellipsis max-h-[calc(1.5em*2)] leading-snug line-clamp-2 md:text-[20px]"><span><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954-ep-6">EP 6<!-- -->-<!-- -->Forced Humiliation</a></span></h2><div class="text-[#A3A3A3] text-[14px] break-words mt-[0.875rem] poppins overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-3">A character is pressured to kneel before a powerful figure, Mr. Chuck, highlighting a moment of intense humiliation and power imbalance, which leads to a dramatic declaration of quitting.Will the protagonist&#x27;s decision to quit lead to a confrontation with Mr. Chuck?</div></div></div><div class="flex mb-4 h-[11.75rem] cursor-pointer"><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954"><img alt="Love Lights My Way Back Home" loading="lazy" width="142" height="188" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[8.875rem] h-full rounded-lg max-w-none object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/43b6a9970c35422baf80e052de692c6c~tplv-vod-noop.image"/></a><div class="ml-4 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis"><h2 class="text-white poppins-bold text-[14px] font-bold break-words overflow-hidden text-ellipsis max-h-[calc(1.5em*2)] leading-snug line-clamp-2 md:text-[20px]"><span><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954-ep-7">EP 7<!-- -->-<!-- -->Birthday Tensions</a></span></h2><div class="text-[#A3A3A3] text-[14px] break-words mt-[0.875rem] poppins overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-3">Chuck plans a lavish birthday party and invites his classmates, including Sunny, whom he bullies. Sunny refuses to attend, hinting at her painful past and the unresolved tension between them.Will Sunny&#x27;s defiance lead to a confrontation with Chuck at his birthday party?</div></div></div><div class="flex mb-4 h-[11.75rem] cursor-pointer"><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954"><img alt="Love Lights My Way Back Home" loading="lazy" width="142" height="188" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[8.875rem] h-full rounded-lg max-w-none object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a204