re sinister?</div></div></div><div class="flex mb-4 h-[11.75rem] cursor-pointer"><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954"><img alt="Love Lights My Way Back Home" loading="lazy" width="142" height="188" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[8.875rem] h-full rounded-lg max-w-none object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/54783054b89145e79e8747fabc822927~tplv-vod-noop.image"/></a><div class="ml-4 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis"><h2 class="text-white poppins-bold text-[14px] font-bold break-words overflow-hidden text-ellipsis max-h-[calc(1.5em*2)] leading-snug line-clamp-2 md:text-[20px]"><span><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954-ep-10">EP 10<!-- -->-<!-- -->The Bullying Incident</a></span></h2><div class="text-[#A3A3A3] text-[14px] break-words mt-[0.875rem] poppins overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-3">Sunny&#x27;s twin brother and his friends cruelly mock and bully Sunny&#x27;s adoptive father, unaware of their shared family connection, escalating the tension between the siblings.Will Sunny discover the truth about her twin brother and confront him about his cruel behavior?</div></div></div><div class="flex mb-4 h-[11.75rem] cursor-pointer"><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954"><img alt="Love Lights My Way Back Home" loading="lazy" width="142" height="188" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[8.875rem] h-full rounded-lg max-w-none object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/609f654d1f78483fa952c6fa35531563~tplv-vod-noop.image"/></a><div class="ml-4 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis"><h2 class="text-white poppins-bold text-[14px] font-bold break-words overflow-hidden text-ellipsis max-h-[calc(1.5em*2)] leading-snug line-clamp-2 md:text-[20px]"><span><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954-ep-11">EP 11<!-- -->-<!-- -->The Birthday Wish</a></span></h2><div class="text-[#A3A3A3] text-[14px] break-words mt-[0.875rem] poppins overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-3">At a party, Mr. Chuck makes a heartfelt wish for Bonnie&#x27;s return, revealing a deep longing for reconciliation, only for chaos to ensue when someone reacts violently to the mention of Bonnie&#x27;s name.Who is so opposed to Bonnie&#x27;s return that they react with such hostility?</div></div></div><div class="flex mb-4 h-[11.75rem] cursor-pointer"><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954"><img alt="Love Lights My Way Back Home" loading="lazy" width="142" height="188" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[8.875rem] h-full rounded-lg max-w-none object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/86f631323faa474c9b5330c892b8ec66~tplv-vod-noop.image"/></a><div class="ml-4 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis"><h2 class="text-white poppins-bold text-[14px] font-bold break-words overflow-hidden text-ellipsis max-h-[calc(1.5em*2)] leading-snug line-clamp-2 md:text-[20px]"><span><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954-ep-12">EP 12<!-- -->-<!-- -->A Mother&#x27;s Fury</a></span></h2><div class="text-[#A3A3A3] text-[14px] break-words mt-[0.875rem] poppins overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-3">A heated confrontation erupts when a mother fiercely defends her daughter Sunny from attackers, leading to a moment of recognition that hints at a deeper connection between Sunny and one of the assailants.Who is the mysterious person that recognizes Sunny, and what is their hidden connection?</div></div></div><div class="flex mb-4 h-[11.75rem] cursor-pointer"><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954"><img alt="Love Lights My Way Back Home" loading="lazy" width="142" height="188" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[8.875rem] h-full rounded-lg max-w-none object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="https://a