 missing necklace and her connection to the Golden family?</div></div></div><div class="flex mb-4 h-[11.75rem] cursor-pointer"><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954"><img alt="Love Lights My Way Back Home" loading="lazy" width="142" height="188" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[8.875rem] h-full rounded-lg max-w-none object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/967a98c23ef34c9e95805b0664b579c6~tplv-vod-noop.image"/></a><div class="ml-4 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis"><h2 class="text-white poppins-bold text-[14px] font-bold break-words overflow-hidden text-ellipsis max-h-[calc(1.5em*2)] leading-snug line-clamp-2 md:text-[20px]"><span><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954-ep-15">EP 15<!-- -->-<!-- -->Stolen Necklace Accusation</a></span></h2><div class="text-[#A3A3A3] text-[14px] break-words mt-[0.875rem] poppins overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-3">Sunny is falsely accused of stealing Mrs. Golden&#x27;s unique necklace, a gift from Chuck, and faces intense prejudice and demands from the Golden family, despite her protests of innocence.Will Sunny be able to prove her innocence and uncover the real thief?</div></div></div><div class="flex mb-4 h-[11.75rem] cursor-pointer"><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954"><img alt="Love Lights My Way Back Home" loading="lazy" width="142" height="188" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[8.875rem] h-full rounded-lg max-w-none object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/768cdb07bfcf46a7b3b9bb786f13cfbd~tplv-vod-noop.image"/></a><div class="ml-4 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis"><h2 class="text-white poppins-bold text-[14px] font-bold break-words overflow-hidden text-ellipsis max-h-[calc(1.5em*2)] leading-snug line-clamp-2 md:text-[20px]"><span><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954-ep-16">EP 16<!-- -->-<!-- -->The Necklace Conflict</a></span></h2><div class="text-[#A3A3A3] text-[14px] break-words mt-[0.875rem] poppins overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-3">Bonnie is violently searched and accused of stealing a necklace by her wealthy classmate&#x27;s family, leading to a tense confrontation where her innocence is proven at the last moment, but not without leaving a threat of future retaliation.Will Bonnie be able to uncover the truth behind her banishment before the wealthy family makes good on their threat?</div></div></div><div class="flex mb-4 h-[11.75rem] cursor-pointer"><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954"><img alt="Love Lights My Way Back Home" loading="lazy" width="142" height="188" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[8.875rem] h-full rounded-lg max-w-none object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/0913a2425c964cdc9e067f94a5049be6~tplv-vod-noop.image"/></a><div class="ml-4 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis"><h2 class="text-white poppins-bold text-[14px] font-bold break-words overflow-hidden text-ellipsis max-h-[calc(1.5em*2)] leading-snug line-clamp-2 md:text-[20px]"><span><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954-ep-17">EP 17<!-- -->-<!-- -->The Hidden Truth Revealed</a></span></h2><div class="text-[#A3A3A3] text-[14px] break-words mt-[0.875rem] poppins overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-3">Bonnie, who has been living under the identity of Sunny, faces bullying from her wealthy classmate—unbeknownst to both, her twin brother. Amidst the chaos, a critical moment unfolds when a character, possibly a caretaker, discovers something shocking related to Bonnie&#x27;s true identity, hinting at the unraveling of long-held family secrets.What shocking discovery about Bonnie&#x27;s past will come to light next?</div></div></div><div class="flex mb-4 h-[11.75rem] cursor-pointer"><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954"><img alt="Love Lights My Way Back Home" loading="lazy" width="142" height="188" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[8.875rem] h-full rounded-lg max-w-none object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/f8f4e7fa14934ee9848c21a3beccb1a5~tplv-vod-noop.image"/></a><div class="ml-4 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis"><h2 class="text-white poppins-bold text-[14px] font-bold break-words overflow-hidden text-ellipsis max-h-[calc(1.5em*2)] leading-snug line-clamp-2 md:text-[20px]"><span><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954-ep-18">EP 18<!-- -->-<!-- -->The Search for Bonnie</a></span></h2><div class="text-[#A3A3A3] text-[14px] break-words mt-[0.875rem] poppins overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-3">During a student event, a bangle half is found, leading the family to believe Bonnie is present among the guests. They plan a campus-wide health check to identify her through DNA, while also dealing with a family member&#x27;s serious health condition.Will the DNA health check reveal Bonnie&#x27;s true identity, and how will her family react to the discovery?</div></div></div><div class="flex mb-4 h-[11.75rem] cursor-pointer"><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954"><img alt="Love Lights My Way Back Home" loading="lazy" width="142" height="188" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[8.875rem] h-full rounded-lg max-w-none object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/2f964c700eae43f89eb53ec16322067b~tplv-vod-noop.image"/></a><div class="ml-4 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis"><h2 class="text-white poppins-bold text-[14px] font-bold break-words overflow-hidden text-ellipsis max-h-[calc(1.5em*2)] leading-snug line-clamp-2 md:text-[20px]"><span><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954-ep-19">EP 19<!-- -->-<!-- -->Tutoring for a Cause</a></span></h2><div class="text-[#A3A3A3] text-[14px] break-words mt-[0.875rem] poppins overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-3">Sunny, struggling to earn money for her sick father, is unexpectedly offered a lucrative tutoring job by her wealthy classmate (unbeknownst to them, her twin brother), despite his mother&#x27;s disapproval and prejudice against her.Will Sunny&#x27;s tutoring job lead her closer to uncovering her true identity and the secrets of her past?</div></div></div><div class="flex mb-4 h-[11.75rem] cursor-pointer"><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954"><img alt="Love Lights My Way Back Home" loading="lazy" width="142" height="188" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[8.875rem] h-full rounded-lg max-w-none object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/6b48dacf6dbc422790652cc7894d0fc4~tplv-vod-noop.image"/></a><div class="ml-4 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis"><h2 class="text-white poppins-bold text-[14px] font-bold break-words overflow-hidden text-ellipsis max-h-[calc(1.5em*2)] leading-snug line-clamp-2 md:text-[20px]"><span><a href="/episode/love-lights-my-way-back-home-1808387443220733954-ep-20">EP 20<!-- -->-<!-- -->The Drowning Secret</a></span></h2><div class="text-[#A3A3A3] text-[14px] break-words mt-[0.875rem] poppins overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-3">Sunny faces bullying from her wealthy classmate, who turns out to be her twin brother, and a near-fatal incident reveals deeper family conflicts and secrets.Will Sunny uncover the truth about her past after this life-threatening encounter?</div></div></div></div><nav class="my-16 md:my-10 flex justify-center px-4" aria-label="Pagination" data-testid="pagination-prev-next"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-4 sm:gap-5 text-white/90"><button type="button" disabled="" aria-label="Previous" class="group flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-not-allowed opacit